{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"타임캡슐","artist":"다비치","date":"2026-09-08","sourceId":"15101264:008","sourceHash":"80a3a5e0bcf75265068a531c5eb676e0a3872e128cf4dd78bfe5fe15e9fe52f2","duration":91.4,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":17.6,"end":22.9,"text":"먼지 쌓인 서랍과 남아있던","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.14,"end":25.7,"text":"그 작았던 꼬만 자라있어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":25.75,"end":31.3,"text":"우리는 오늘 만난 거야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":31.62,"end":37.2,"text":"다시 가 볼게 네 손을 잡은 채","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":37.74,"end":40.7,"text":"어디로 가 볼까요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":41.04,"end":44.3,"text":"어떤 삶이 되어볼까요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":44.45,"end":49.8,"text":"우리가 두 손 잡으면 다가올 미래에서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":49.86,"end":53.1,"text":"무엇도 두렵지 않아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":53.31,"end":58.8,"text":"어디도 못 갔지만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":59.42,"end":63.1,"text":"웅크려 있었던 것 뿐이야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":63.39,"end":68.4,"text":"이제 다시 툭툭 일어서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":68.58,"end":80.9,"text":"한 걸음 두 걸음 널 믿고서 난 걸어갈 거야","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":80.96,"end":83.81,"text":"널 보게 된 마지막","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":83.85,"end":88.0,"text":"우리가 만난 마지막","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}